<item><title>Mali parliament approves 43 million euros for 144 communes</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/mali-parliament-approves-43-million-euros-for-144-communes-068545/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/mali-parliament-approves-43-million-euros-for-144-communes-068545/</guid><category>Mali</category><description>The funding will support water, health care, education and farming and pastoral activities in six central and northern regions through June 2028.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:35:28 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ml.jpg" length="29829" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ml.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mali&apos;s transition council ratifies Aoua Keïta centre&apos;s new status</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/mali-s-transition-council-ratifies-aoua-keita-centre-s-new-787b55/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/mali-s-transition-council-ratifies-aoua-keita-centre-s-new-787b55/</guid><category>Mali</category><description>The change gives the women&apos;s vocational training centre administrative and financial autonomy through a board, directorate and scientific committee.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:47:16 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ml.jpg" length="29829" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ml.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mali&apos;s cabinet adopts new rules for private health providers</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/mali-s-cabinet-adopts-new-rules-for-private-health-providers-ab655a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/mali-s-cabinet-adopts-new-rules-for-private-health-providers-ab655a/</guid><category>Mali</category><description>The proposed texts replace regulations from 1985 and 1991 to cover newer medical facilities and specialties in the private sector.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:35:04 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/mali-s-cabinet-adopts-new-rules-for-private-health-providers-ab655a/share.jpg" length="40719" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/mali-s-cabinet-adopts-new-rules-for-private-health-providers-ab655a/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tuareg craft week puts young women’s veil tradition in focus</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/tuareg-craft-week-puts-young-women-s-veil-tradition-in-focus-d9059d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/tuareg-craft-week-puts-young-women-s-veil-tradition-in-focus-d9059d/</guid><category>Mali</category><description>At Mali’s National Museum, the event’s third edition has prompted a discussion of when the veil is worn and what it means in Tuareg society.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:30:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ml.jpg" length="29829" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ml.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Ségou court hands down terms of 10 to 20 years in seven cases</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/segou-court-hands-down-terms-of-10-to-20-years-in-seven-3a86d9/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/segou-court-hands-down-terms-of-10-to-20-years-in-seven-3a86d9/</guid><category>Mali</category><description>Two defendants received 20-year sentences and two others were acquitted at the chamber&apos;s first hearing, which ended on Thursday, 19 November.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 11:25:59 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ml.jpg" length="29829" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ml.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
